---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { LAST_UPDATED, CLARITY_ID } from '../../data/site-config';
import { route } from '../../i18n/routes';
const lang = 'en';
---
<PageLayout title="Cookies on Solo Tax Desk: none set, and how to check it 2026" description="Solo Tax Desk stores no cookie and nothing in your browser storage while you work out your 2026 taxes: no tracking pixel, no ad tag, no lead form. How to check it yourself." lang={lang} noindex={true} breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Cookies' }]} showAuthor={false}>
  <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none prose-headings:font-serif">
    <h1>Cookies</h1>
    <p>This site sets no cookie and uses no local storage. Your profit, state or salary exist only in the open page, and in its address if you copy a share link.</p>
    <h2>No banner, and why</h2>
    <p>A consent banner is needed when a site stores or reads non-essential information on your device. Nothing of the kind happens here. {CLARITY_ID ? 'The cookie-free stability measurement described in the privacy policy stores nothing on your device either.' : 'No analytics or advertising script is loaded.'}</p>
    <h2>Check it yourself</h2>
    <p>Open your browser's developer tools (F12), tab Application or Storage: Cookies and Local Storage stay empty for this site while you use any calculator. In the Network tab, typing a number sends no request at all.</p>
    <p>See also the <a href={route('privacy', lang)}>privacy policy</a>. Updated: {LAST_UPDATED}.</p>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
